<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">soredemo bokura shinpuru na omoi wo tsutaetai dake na no</font></font></b></font></font>

6
00:00:20,870 --> 00:00:28,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">I just want to convey my simple thoughts</font></font></b></font></font>

7
00:00:28,510 --> 00:00:34,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">fukinukeru kusunda ano hi no kaze wa</font></font></b></font></font>

8
00:00:28,510 --> 00:00:34,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">that day's faint wind blows away</font></font></b></font></font>

9
00:00:34,180 --> 00:00:39,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">kinou no haikyo ni uchi sutete</font></font></b></font></font>

10
00:00:34,180 --> 00:00:39,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">at the castle ruins of yesterday</font></font></b></font></font>

11
00:00:39,180 --> 00:00:43,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">kimi to warau ima wo ikiru no da</font></font></b></font></font>

12
00:00:39,180 --> 00:00:43,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">I'll laugh with you and live for the moment</font></font></b></font></font>

13
00:00:45,320 --> 00:00:53,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">soredemo ano dekigoto ga kimi wo kurushimeru daro</font></font></b></font></font>

14
00:00:45,320 --> 00:00:53,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">still that incident will continue to trouble you, right?</font></font></b></font></font>

15
00:00:53,000 --> 00:00:56,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">dakarakoso sayonara nanda</font></font></b></font></font>

16
00:00:53,000 --> 00:00:56,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">that's why it must be good-bye</font></font></b></font></font>

17
00:00:56,970 --> 00:01:04,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">konomama nanimo nokorazu ni anata to wakachiau dake</font></font></b></font></font>

18
00:00:56,970 --> 00:01:04,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">leaving nothing behind, let us share what is left</font></font></b></font></font>

19
00:01:04,280 --> 00:01:11,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">yagate bokura wa sore ga subetee dato kigatsuite</font></font></b></font></font>

20
00:01:04,280 --> 00:01:11,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">in time, we'll realize that it was everything</font></font></b></font></font>

21
00:01:11,320 --> 00:01:18,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">kanashimi wa hoo wo tsutatte namida no kawa ni naru dake</font></font></b></font></font>

22
00:01:11,320 --> 00:01:18,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">and sadness will touch our cheeks, creating a river of tears</font></font></b></font></font>

23
00:01:18,490 --> 00:01:27,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">yureru omoi wa tsuyoi uzu ni n<font color="#ffffff">atte tokeau no yo</font></font></font></b></font></font>

24
00:01:18,490 --> 00:01:27,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">Trembling thoughts swept into a vortex and melting away</font></font></b></font></font>

25
00:01:38,870 --> 00:01:40,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Where's the other one?</font>

26
00:01:41,080 --> 00:01:42,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey...</font>

27
00:01:44,120 --> 00:01:45,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who are you looking for?</font>

28
00:01:48,250 --> 00:01:52,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll take care of the rest.
Go wash your eyes in that river.</font>

29
00:01:56,470 --> 00:02:00,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is my ability...
specializing in assassination of course.</font>

30
00:02:00,850 --> 00:02:05,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You can't beat me by just having
a good nose and nails...</font>

31
00:02:06,100 --> 00:02:08,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You can't beat my ability!</font>

32
00:02:18,200 --> 00:02:21,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Akamaru... I'm sorry...</font>

33
00:02:21,780 --> 00:02:25,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Akamaru...
We've always done things together.</font>

34
00:02:25,700 --> 00:02:27,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We were together
whenever and wherever.</font>

35
00:02:28,620 --> 00:02:32,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">However this one time I'm sunk.</font>

36
00:02:32,920 --> 00:02:37,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My cells can swim inside
your body as I wish</font>

37
00:02:37,720 --> 00:02:40,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and I can even create parts
that are only you.</font>

38
00:02:40,550 --> 00:02:43,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In other words,
a little bit of a fusion condition...</font>

39
00:02:43,350 --> 00:02:45,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">a sharing of the flesh is what it'll be.</font>

40
00:02:47,060 --> 00:02:49,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A sharing...?</font>

41
00:02:49,480 --> 00:02:50,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's right!</font>

42
00:02:51,060 --> 00:02:54,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And a cruel way of killing
that only I can accomplish...</font>

43
00:02:54,980 --> 00:02:58,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the gradual scraping off
of just your cells!</font>

44
00:02:59,490 --> 00:03:00,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see...</font>

45
00:03:08,370 --> 00:03:09,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If that's the case...!</font>

46
00:03:19,090 --> 00:03:22,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If I do this...
what's gonna happen?</font>

47
00:03:24,800 --> 00:03:27,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Suicide?! That's ridiculous!</font>

48
00:03:30,310 --> 00:03:31,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Die with me...</font>

49
00:03:32,350 --> 00:03:38,360
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Everyone's Fight</font>

50
00:04:03,590 --> 00:04:06,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What are you thinking?!</font>

51
00:04:14,900 --> 00:04:20,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's just as I thought...
We are sharing one body, right?</font>

52
00:04:21,110 --> 00:04:22,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it!</font>

53
00:04:23,110 --> 00:04:27,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Entering my opponent's body
to avoid any attacks...</font>

54
00:04:27,870 --> 00:04:30,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that is my Jutsu's greatest advantage.</font>

55
00:04:31,450 --> 00:04:33,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There hasn't been
a single one before now</font>

56
00:04:33,160 --> 00:04:34,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">who's done this sort of thing.</font>

57
00:04:36,130 --> 00:04:37,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you in pain?</font>

58
00:04:38,130 --> 00:04:41,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right then, let's get comfortable now.</font>

59
00:04:43,170 --> 00:04:45,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yikes, you idiot!
Stop it!</font>

60
00:04:45,800 --> 00:04:47,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's too late!</font>

61
00:05:04,570 --> 00:05:06,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's not enough blood...</font>

62
00:05:27,130 --> 00:05:28,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn!</font>

63
00:05:31,810 --> 00:05:32,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn...</font>

64
00:05:33,600 --> 00:05:35,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Where'd he go?</font>

65
00:05:49,820 --> 00:05:52,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So he left his little dog behind
and fled.</font>

66
00:05:53,160 --> 00:05:57,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's the right decision,
but he's more cold-hearted than me.</font>

67
00:06:09,550 --> 00:06:10,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

68
00:06:10,680 --> 00:06:11,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It couldn't be!</font>

69
00:06:32,620 --> 00:06:36,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What a relief...
He's still breathing.</font>

70
00:06:40,460 --> 00:06:41,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What a relief!</font>

71
00:06:57,270 --> 00:07:00,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Akamaru... You really gave it your best.</font>

72
00:07:02,020 --> 00:07:05,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Because of you I was able to hold up
the enemy for a while.</font>

73
00:07:05,780 --> 00:07:07,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We've caused injuries
upon the enemy too.</font>

74
00:07:09,150 --> 00:07:13,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's enough... You've done enough.</font>

75
00:07:31,430 --> 00:07:33,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">His name is Akamaru.</font>

76
00:07:33,470 --> 00:07:34,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

77
00:07:35,430 --> 00:07:37,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Mom... Nee-chan...</font>

78
00:07:38,680 --> 00:07:41,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">From today you'll take care of him...
Okay?</font>

79
00:07:42,980 --> 00:07:44,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I will?</font>

80
00:08:01,000 --> 00:08:04,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm Kiba. Nice to meet you, Akamaru.</font>

81
00:08:13,050 --> 00:08:14,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You!</font>

82
00:08:28,020 --> 00:08:29,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We've been together forever.</font>

83
00:08:33,860 --> 00:08:35,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Nice catch, Akamaru!</font>

84
00:08:38,080 --> 00:08:40,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right, you did well!</font>

85
00:08:42,000 --> 00:08:43,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here we go!</font>

86
00:08:51,920 --> 00:08:53,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Be more serious about it!</font>

87
00:08:56,890 --> 00:08:58,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stop being such a baby!</font>

88
00:08:59,350 --> 00:09:00,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Mom...</font>

89
00:09:08,520 --> 00:09:09,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Listen, Kiba...</font>

90
00:09:10,320 --> 00:09:11,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's not just you.</font>

91
00:09:11,940 --> 00:09:13,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Akamaru and you,</font>

92
00:09:13,280 --> 00:09:15,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the two of you need
to become strong together.</font>

93
00:09:16,610 --> 00:09:19,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">With Akamaru... Together?</font>

94
00:09:23,120 --> 00:09:24,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Akamaru...</font>

95
00:09:34,720 --> 00:09:36,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's right.</font>

96
00:09:40,600 --> 00:09:43,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Way to go, Akamaru! You did it!</font>

97
00:09:43,180 --> 00:09:45,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Mid-air Dynamic Marking!</font>

98
00:09:46,690 --> 00:09:50,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Next is mid-air triple somersault!
Take your aim!</font>

99
00:09:57,570 --> 00:09:58,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yahoo!</font>

100
00:10:03,450 --> 00:10:05,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yahoo!</font>

101
00:10:20,180 --> 00:10:22,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We'll be together forever
from now on too...</font>

102
00:10:23,560 --> 00:10:26,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll protect you from now on!</font>

103
00:10:34,280 --> 00:10:35,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That jerk!</font>

104
00:10:36,440 --> 00:10:38,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Setting up a trap on me!</font>

105
00:10:52,420 --> 00:10:54,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll kill you!</font>

106
00:10:57,590 --> 00:11:01,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey! Sakon! Where are you?! Sakon!</font>

107
00:11:10,310 --> 00:11:11,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakon!</font>

108
00:11:13,400 --> 00:11:14,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakon!</font>

109
00:11:18,110 --> 00:11:20,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Blah, blah, blah.
You're such a nuisance, aniki.</font>

110
00:11:20,990 --> 00:11:23,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Your yelling stings my eyes...</font>

111
00:11:25,410 --> 00:11:26,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Aniki!</font>

112
00:11:26,830 --> 00:11:28,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll kill him... is what I'd like to do</font>

113
00:11:29,000 --> 00:11:30,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but it's almost time for my sleep.</font>

114
00:11:31,460 --> 00:11:34,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Capture those bastards alive in my place.</font>

115
00:11:35,630 --> 00:11:37,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">When I wake up
I'll kill them.</font>

116
00:11:38,130 --> 00:11:41,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right, Sakon?
Capture them alive...</font>

117
00:11:41,630 --> 00:11:43,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah, I got it...</font>

118
00:11:43,970 --> 00:11:44,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But...</font>

119
00:11:45,720 --> 00:11:47,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The killing part
we'll do it together.</font>

120
00:12:19,420 --> 00:12:21,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If I carelessly attack,</font>

121
00:12:21,220 --> 00:12:23,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">he dodges
and I end up attacking myself!</font>

122
00:12:54,710 --> 00:12:55,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Behold!</font>

123
00:12:55,710 --> 00:12:57,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Willow Dance!</font>

124
00:13:23,030 --> 00:13:24,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You!</font>

125
00:13:42,250 --> 00:13:43,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Bones?</font>

126
00:13:53,350 --> 00:13:56,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is my... Kekkei Genkai.</font>

127
00:14:24,880 --> 00:14:27,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's with this guy...?</font>

128
00:14:27,800 --> 00:14:30,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is he attacking with bones sticking out
from all over his body?</font>

129
00:15:07,340 --> 00:15:10,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's grabbed his own bone!</font>

130
00:15:22,060 --> 00:15:23,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It'll be soon...</font>

131
00:15:27,480 --> 00:15:30,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's turning the bone...
into a sword!</font>

132
00:15:39,370 --> 00:15:43,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's futile. It's not just ordinary bone.</font>

133
00:15:44,290 --> 00:15:48,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The highest density bone is hard as steel.</font>

134
00:15:48,920 --> 00:15:53,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So what?! I'll break that bone!</font>

135
00:15:53,720 --> 00:15:56,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I possess Five Dances.</font>

136
00:15:59,220 --> 00:16:03,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You'd better not think
you know my strength after just this much.</font>

137
00:16:03,850 --> 00:16:04,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

138
00:16:08,320 --> 00:16:10,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll specially show you...</font>

139
00:16:11,490 --> 00:16:13,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the Camellia Dance next.</font>

140
00:16:15,990 --> 00:16:16,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Come!</font>

141
00:16:17,950 --> 00:16:19,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll crush you!</font>

142
00:16:31,340 --> 00:16:32,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I did it!</font>

143
00:16:33,680 --> 00:16:34,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's a Substitution?!</font>

144
00:16:40,720 --> 00:16:41,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There!</font>

145
00:16:42,680 --> 00:16:43,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn!</font>

146
00:16:53,990 --> 00:16:57,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They're getting closer and closer.</font>

147
00:16:59,620 --> 00:17:00,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn!</font>

148
00:17:10,460 --> 00:17:12,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This isn't good, traces of blood!</font>

149
00:17:13,970 --> 00:17:17,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn, I did save Akamaru
for the time being</font>

150
00:17:17,800 --> 00:17:19,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but maybe I went too far.</font>

151
00:17:40,450 --> 00:17:43,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This smell...
What does it mean?</font>

152
00:17:45,290 --> 00:17:48,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why... Why is it that even those guys
are headed to a place like this?!</font>

153
00:17:49,750 --> 00:17:51,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't understand anymore.</font>

154
00:17:52,170 --> 00:17:55,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In any case,
