157
00:18:04,470 --> 00:18:06,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My body won't move at all either...</font>

158
00:18:11,860 --> 00:18:13,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Akamaru...</font>

159
00:18:47,230 --> 00:18:49,270
