160
00:18:51,400 --> 00:18:52,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

161
00:18:57,820 --> 00:19:00,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So he fled by floating down the river...</font>

162
00:19:00,860 --> 00:19:02,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn!</font>

163
00:19:08,000 --> 00:19:09,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn!</font>

164
00:19:17,090 --> 00:19:18,090
